han the DK-210 successor because it was in stock.\n- **5 \u00d7 MN-32 32-inch 5K Monitor** (new): $2,645\n- **Total: $3,590**\n\nThe total is over the $2,500 threshold, so it needed manager approval. The order shows human approval as \"Approved. Looks right.\" and its status is \"placed.\" The ship-to was entered as \"HQ\" because that is the only location name I had, so confirm it matches the delivery address the team expects.", "type": "text"}]}]}